{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "```python\ndef comb_sort(list_of_numbers: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of numbers using the comb sort algorithm.\n    It modifies the input list in-place and returns it.\"\"\"\n    n = len(list_of_numbers)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return list_of_numbers\n\n    gap = n\n    shrink_factor = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        if gap > 1:\n            gap = int(gap / shrink_factor)\n            if gap < 1:\n                gap = 1\n\n        swapped = False\n        i = 0\n        while i + gap < n:\n            if list_of_numbers[i] > list_of_numbers[i + gap]:\n                list_of_numbers[i], list_of_numbers[i + gap] = list_of_numbers[i + gap], list_of_numbers[i]\n                swapped = True\n            i += 1\n    return list_of_numbers\n```"}
