{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "```python\ndef divisor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the number of positive divisors for a given integer n.\n    Returns the total count of positive divisors.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        # For non-positive integers, the number of positive divisors is 0.\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i * i == n:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n        i += 1\n    return count\n```"}
