{"task_id": "Mbpp/97", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any\n\ndef frequency_lists(input_list_of_lists: List[List[Any]]) -> Dict[Any, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a list of lists and calculates the frequency of each element.\n    Returns a dictionary where keys are elements and values are their counts.\n    \"\"\"\n    flattened_list = []\n    for sublist in input_list_of_lists:\n        for item in sublist:\n            flattened_list.append(item)\n\n    frequency_dict = {}\n    for element in flattened_list:\n        frequency_dict[element] = frequency_dict.get(element, 0) + 1\n\n    return frequency_dict\n```"}
