{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def _get_divisors(n: int) -> set[int]:\n    \"\"\"Finds all positive divisors of a given integer.\n    Returns a set containing these divisors.\"\"\"\n    divs = set()\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            divs.add(i)\n    return divs\n\ndef sum(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all positive common divisors for two given integer numbers.\n    It utilizes an internal helper function to find divisors.\"\"\"\n    divisors1 = _get_divisors(num1)\n    divisors2 = _get_divisors(num2)\n    common_divs = divisors1.intersection(divisors2)\n    return sum(common_divs)"}
