{"task_id": "Mbpp/165", "solution": "```python\ndef count_char_position(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts characters whose 1-based string position matches their 1-based alphabetical position.\n    Comparison is case-insensitive (A=1, B=2, ... Z=26).\n    \"\"\"\n    match_count = 0\n    for zero_based_index, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        char_1_based_index = zero_based_index + 1\n        lower_char = char.lower()\n\n        alpha_1_based_position = 0\n        if 'a' <= lower_char <= 'z':\n            alpha_1_based_position = ord(lower_char) - ord('a') + 1\n\n        if alpha_1_based_position == char_1_based_index:\n            match_count += 1\n\n    return match_count\n```"}
