{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k) using factorials.\n    This helper function computes n! / (k! * (n-k)!).\n    \"\"\"\n    n_factorial = math.factorial(n)\n    k_factorial = math.factorial(k)\n    n_minus_k_factorial = math.factorial(n - k)\n    return n_factorial // (k_factorial * n_minus_k_factorial)\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of binomial coefficients C(n, k) for even indices k.\n    It iterates k from 0 to n (inclusive) with a step of 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum\n```\n"}
