{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "```python\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given n.\n    It iterates through even k, computes C(n, k), and sums them up.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
