{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "```python\nimport collections\n\ndef validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in an integer is less than or equal to the digit's value.\n    Returns True if valid, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    number_str = str(abs(number))\n    digit_counts = collections.Counter(number_str)\n\n    for digit_char, frequency in digit_counts.items():\n        digit_value = int(digit_char)\n        if frequency > digit_value:\n            return False\n\n    return True\n```"}
