{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "```python\ndef shell_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts an array using the Shell Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n // 2\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and arr[j - gap] > temp:\n                arr[j] = arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            arr[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return arr\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(arr: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list using the Shell Sort algorithm in ascending order.\n    Returns a new sorted list without modifying the original.\n    \"\"\"\n    mutable_arr = list(arr)  # Create a copy to avoid modifying the original list.\n    n = len(mutable_arr)\n\n    gap = n // 2\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = mutable_arr[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and mutable_arr[j - gap] > temp:\n                mutable_arr[j] = mutable_arr[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            mutable_arr[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return mutable_arr"}
