{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "```python\ndef _get_nth_perrin(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the Nth Perrin number.\n    This function uses an iterative approach to generate and return the Nth Perrin number.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 3  # P(0)=3\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0  # P(1)=0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2  # P(2)=2\n    else:\n        # P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3) for n > 2\n        p_sequence = [3, 0, 2]\n\n        for i in range(3, n + 1):\n            p_n = p_sequence[i-2] + p_sequence[i-3]\n            p_sequence.append(p_n)\n\n        return p_sequence[n]\n\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    It iterates from 0 to n, summing each Perrin number found by a helper function.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        # Returning 0 for negative n as per design specification\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        perrin_num = _get_nth_perrin(i)\n        total_sum += perrin_num\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n    It considers positive factors by taking the absolute value of the input.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    absolute_number = abs(number)\n\n    for i in range(1, absolute_number + 1):\n        if absolute_number % i == 0:  # Check if i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:  # Check if the factor is even\n                total_sum += i\n    return total_sum\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given integer.\n    It iterates from 1 to the number, checking for factors that are also even.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_even_factors = 0\n    for i in range(1, number + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                sum_of_even_factors += i\n    return sum_of_even_factors\n```"}
