{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "```python\nclass DifferenceCalculator:\n    \"\"\"\n    Encapsulates the core logic for calculating differences between sums.\n    It provides methods to compute sums of natural numbers and their cubes.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the sum of the first n natural numbers using a direct formula.\n        This method returns an integer result.\n        \"\"\"\n        return n * (n + 1) // 2\n\n    def _calculate_sum_of_cubes(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n        It leverages the mathematical identity relating to the sum of natural numbers.\n        \"\"\"\n        sum_of_naturals = self._calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(n)\n        return sum_of_naturals ** 2\n\n    def calculate_difference(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Orchestrates the calculation of the difference between the sum of cubes\n        and the sum of natural numbers for a given 'n'.\n        \"\"\"\n        sum_of_cubes = self._calculate_sum_of_cubes(n)\n        sum_of_naturals = self._calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(n)\n        return sum_of_cubes - sum_of_naturals\n\ndef difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    calculator = DifferenceCalculator()\n    return calculator.calculate_difference(n)\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "```python\ndef difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Sum of first n natural numbers formula: n * (n + 1) / 2\n    sum_natural_numbers = n * (n + 1) // 2\n\n    # Sum of cubes of first n natural numbers formula: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_cubes = sum_natural_numbers * sum_natural_numbers\n\n    return sum_cubes - sum_natural_numbers\n```"}
