{"task_id": "Mbpp/586", "solution": "```python\ndef split_Arr(input_list: list, n: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Splits a list at the nth element and reorders it by moving the prefix to the end.\n    Handles various edge cases for n and empty lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    if n <= 0 or n >= len(input_list):\n        return input_list\n\n    prefix = input_list[:n]\n    suffix = input_list[n:]\n\n    return suffix + prefix\n```"}
