{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "import math\n\ndef prime_num(value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if an integer is a prime number based on its mathematical definition.\n    Numbers less than or equal to 1 are not prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    if value <= 1:\n        return False\n    if value == 2:\n        return True\n    if value % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    for i in range(3, int(math.isqrt(value)) + 1, 2):\n        if value % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return True"}
