{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "```python\ndef replace_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Replaces all whitespace characters with underscores and all underscore characters with spaces.\n    Returns the transformed string.\n    \"\"\"\n    temp_char = '\\x00'  # Use a temporary, unlikely character\n\n    # Step 1: Replace spaces with the temporary character\n    s_temp = input_string.replace(' ', temp_char)\n\n    # Step 2: Replace underscores with spaces\n    s_modified = s_temp.replace('_', ' ')\n\n    # Step 3: Replace the temporary character with underscores\n    result = s_modified.replace(temp_char, '_')\n\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "```python\ndef replace_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Swaps all whitespace characters with underscores and all underscore characters with spaces\n    in the given string using a temporary character strategy.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Use a unique temporary character unlikely to be in the input string for the two-step swap.\n    temp_char = '\\x00'\n\n    # Step 1: Replace all underscore characters with the temporary character.\n    # This prevents original underscores from being converted to spaces in the next step.\n    intermediate_string = input_string.replace('_', temp_char)\n\n    # Step 2: Replace all common whitespace characters with underscores.\n    # This applies to spaces, tabs, newlines, etc.\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace(' ', '_')\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace('\\t', '_')\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace('\\n', '_')\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace('\\r', '_')\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace('\\f', '_')\n    intermediate_string = intermediate_string.replace('\\v', '_')\n\n    # Step 3: Replace the temporary character with a space.\n    # This completes the swap for the original underscore characters.\n    final_string = intermediate_string.replace(temp_char, ' ')\n\n    return final_string\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "```python\ndef pair_xor_Sum(arr, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR of all unique pairs of numbers in the given list.\n    The parameter 'n' is expected to be the length of the list 'arr'.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            total_xor_sum += (arr[i] ^ arr[j])\n    return total_xor_sum\n```"}
