{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "```python\ndef sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(input_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of products of all possible contiguous sublists.\n    Returns the accumulated sum cast to an integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    for i in range(len(input_list)):\n        current_product = 1\n        for j in range(i, len(input_list)):\n            # The current sublist is implicitly input_list[i...j]\n            current_product *= input_list[j]\n            total_sum += current_product\n\n    return int(total_sum)\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/734", "solution": "```python\ndef sum_Of_Subarray_Prod(input_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of products of all possible sublists of a given list of integers.\n    It iterates through all sublists, computes their products, and sums these products.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    n = len(input_list)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_product = 1\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_product *= input_list[j]\n            total_sum += current_product\n    return total_sum\n```"}
