{"task_id": "Mbpp/771", "solution": "```python\ndef check_expression(expression_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given expression string has balanced brackets.\n    Uses a stack to track opening brackets and verify matches.\n    \"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    bracket_map = {')': '(', '}': '{', ']': '['}\n\n    for char in expression_string:\n        if char in bracket_map.values():\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char in bracket_map:\n            if not stack:\n                return False\n            top_element = stack.pop()\n            if top_element != bracket_map[char]:\n                return False\n\n    return not stack\n\n```"}
