{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "```python\ndef sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are positive integers (1, 2, 3, ...); only odd numbers >= 1 within the range are summed.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through the inclusive range [l, r].\n    for num in range(l, r + 1):\n        # Add number to sum if it's a natural number (>=1) and odd.\n        if num >= 1 and num % 2 != 0:\n            total_sum += num\n    return total_sum\n```"}
